# Photos and video on a call, on the demo call (a pretend call, hexvoice:///?demo=call): scripts/duo tap <ref> scripts/duo-media-call-taps
# The simulator has no camera: its drawer shows black, and its shutter makes a still of its own.
launch hexvoice:///?demo=call
wait 6
shoot call-add
tap call-add
wait 1
shoot call-add-menu
tap Camera
system Allow
wait 2
shoot call-camera
tap camera-shutter
wait 2
shoot call-camera-review
tap camera-keep
wait 2
tap transcript-button
wait 2
shoot call-sent
tap call-add
wait 1
tap Photos
wait 3
shoot call-photos
tap Photo
wait 1
tap Add
wait 3
shoot call-sent-photos
